        "alt_text": "A profile photograph of Donald Trump in a dark suit against a purple background. To his right, an orange asterisk-style burst icon sits inside a red circle with a diagonal line through it, signalling a block or ban. Bold white text at the top reads that all Europeans lost access to a new AI model overnight, and text at the bottom completes the thought: because Washington said so. A credit line reads copyright Gage Skidmore.",
        "height": 1350,
        "media_key": "3_2069688311577206784",
        "public_metrics": {},
        "type": "photo",
        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLkCjb9WYAAVpKY.jpg",
        "width": 1080
      },
      {
        "alt_text": "A purple slide headed What Happened. A paragraph explains that Anthropic released a powerful new AI model called Fable 5, that the US government then blocked every non-US citizen from using it through a single export-control order, and that Anthropic responded by shutting the model down for everyone. Below the text, a light blue illustration shows two halves of an electrical plug pulled apart with a spark between them.",
        "height": 1350,
        "media_key": "3_2069688311560491008",
        "public_metrics": {},
        "type": "photo",
        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLkCjb5XUAAKXNn.jpg",
        "width": 1080
      },
      {
        "alt_text": "A purple slide headed The Problem. The text states that around 70 percent of the EU's cloud infrastructure already runs on foreign providers, that whoever holds the plug decides when it gets pulled, and that Europe currently relies on Trump choosing not to pull it. Below, a light blue illustration shows a cloud rising from a tall server building wired with cables.",
        "height": 1350,
        "media_key": "3_2069688311556251648",
        "public_metrics": {},
        "type": "photo",
        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HLkCjb4WoAAXn70.jpg",
        "width": 1080
      },
      {
